Singularity is an end-game mechanic unlocked by Refine Node 121.

== Buff & Penalties ==
At various atom thresholds you will gain a buff or penalty. These buffs/penalties are only applied if your current atom count is at or above the threshold. Many of these buffs/penalties can be modified via the Mineral and Singularity refine tree nodes, as well as Relic 69. You can view your current buffs/penalties in the lower, right-hand corner of the main Singularity tab.
